{"id":"g2088","title":"Ruta graveolens (ext.)","description":"Äußere Anwendung von Ruta graveolens bei Insertionstendopathie, Epikondylitis, akuter Tendovaginitis und schmerzhaften, hautnahen Knochenmetastasen.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Rezepturpräparat (z.B. Apotheke an der Weleda, WELEDA CH). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Ruta graveolens 10 %. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Insertionstendopathie, Epikondylitis, akute Tendovaginitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1765","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x tgl. betroffenen Bereich einreiben. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach einigen Tagen Beschwerdelinderung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2–4 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Kann phototoxische Reaktionen auslösen, Sonnenbestrahlung vermeiden. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Im weiteren Verlauf ggf. auch "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g1151.html","id":"12504","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Vespa crabro (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 1 % Salbe (Rezepturpräparat, z.B. Apotheke an der Weleda). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": MS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Schmerzhafte, relativ hautnahe Knochenmetastasen "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1766","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Zum Beispiel: "},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Rippenmetastasen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Wirbelsäulen- und Beckenfilialisierung. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x tgl. betroffene Bereiche einreiben. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 15–20 Min. Schmerzlinderung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Da es sich um palliative Erkrankungssituationen handelt, Anwendung so lange, wie sie hilfreich erscheint und dadurch systemische Analgetika mit den bekannten Nebenwirkungen eingespart werden können. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine beobachtet. Kann aber phototoxische Reaktionen auslösen, Sonnenbestrahlung vermeiden. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Begleittherapie gemäß den fortgeschrittenen Erkrankungen immer notwendig. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Analgetika konnten teils pausiert werden."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bei dieser Indikation besonders interessant, da dadurch systemische Analgetika wie NSAR, die auch einer Misteltherapie relativ entgegenwirken, gespart oder ersetzt werden können. Die besten Erfahrungen hat der Autor beim metastasierten Mammakarzinom gemacht. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": LKn. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R2088","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R2088","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Laceulle J. Ruta graveolens – Die Weinraute. Der Merkurstab 2020; 73(3): 190–193. "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-21226-DE","children":[{"type":"text","text":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-21226-DE"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}]}]}]}